@@ -391,7 +391,7 @@
             "title": "Assam  Handicrafts - Metal Work",
             "name": "Assam  Handicrafts - Metal Work",
             "desc": "The workmanship of this craft can be found in the traditional utensils and fancy articles. Fancy articles like xorai and bota used for offering betel-nut and paan have been popular and used till now. Hajo and Sarthebari, two townships near Guwahati have the whole population working in metal. The most used metals are the bell-metal and brass.",
