             "name": "National Gallery of Modern Art",
             "desc": "Inaugurated on March 29, 1954, the National Gallery of Modern Art was formerly the residence of the Maharajas of Jaipur. The museum houses a splendid collection of paintings, some of which are as old as 150 years! Artworks of renowned modern Indian artists, such as Rabindranath Tagore.",
