@@ -939,7 +939,7 @@
           "title": "Delhi- Monument- Safdarjang Tomb",
           "name": "Delhi- Monument- Safdarjang Tomb",
           "desc": "A tomb roughly on the plans of Humayuns tomb, though much smaller in scale is the Tomb of Safdarjung. The mausoleum built with red sandstone and buff stone is faced with marble and stands squarely in the middle of a garden which itself is on the pattern of the Mughal Charbagh style.",
