           "title": "Delhi- Monument- Gyarah Murti",
           "name": "Delhi- Monument- Gyarah Murti",
           "desc": "The Gyarah Murti is a massive black sculpture in stone made by Devi Prasad Roy Choudhary, it depicts the famous Dandi March led by Mahatma Gandhi in 1931 against oppressive salt taxes imposed by the British regime. Delhi has a variety of museums dedicated to different subjects.",
