           "name": "Archaeological Museum, RedFort",
           "desc": "Situated in the historic Red Fort, the Archaeological Museum exhibits objects that date to the Mughal period. On view are manuscripts and firmans that display the fine art of calligraphy. Also on view are paintings, textiles and costumes. The museum also houses relics of the 1857 revolt like maps and weapons.",
