@@ -1042,7 +1042,7 @@
           "title": "National Museum",
           "name": "National Museum",
           "desc": "The National Museum offers a unique insight into the history and culture of India. The museum offers splendid and priceless pieces of Indian art and sculpture that have been arranged in galleries, according to the period to which they belong. It displays a fine collection of fine bronze idols,stone sculptures, textiles, coins and tribal art. The famous sculpture of the Dancing Girl from Mohenjodaro belonging to 2,500 BCE is one of the prized possessions here. A collection of Indian miniature paintings from Mughal, Rajasthani and Pahari schools are also part of the display.",
-          "img": "/state-images/Delhi/national-museum.jpg",
+          "img": "/state-images/Delhi/national-museum.webp",
