@@ -1095,7 +1095,7 @@
             "title": "Brass and Metal Craft",
             "name": "Brass and Metal Craft",
             "desc": "Goa is famous for its brass items, especially samais. It is a custom in Goa that at the time of marriage the parents of the bride present her a set of metalware like kalsa, kalshi, puncharati, ekarati etc. Brass metal casting is a craft passed on from one generation to another. The items produced",
