           },
@@ -1113,7 +1113,7 @@
             "title": "Fibre Craft",
             "name": "Fibre Craft",
             "desc": "The craft of sisal fibre craft was brought to Goa by nuns from Kerala. Full of ornamentation and decoration, these are bascially utilitarian objects. Attractive and colourful shopping bags, ladies purses, coasters and wall hangings are made from banana or sisal fiber.",
