           "desc": "is a unique museum located on the outskirts of Ahmedabad city. Established in 1981, this museum exhibits utensils of all shapes and sizes. The exhibits have been collected from all over the country and have been displayed around a simple courtyard. The collection includes pots used for storing water cooking and serving utensils, spoons, rolling pins, tiffin carriers, vessel for churning buttermilk, storage jars, feeding cups for infants and havan kunds too. The collection includes pottery, terracotta and wooden articles as well. The display gives a glimpse into the lifestyle of people of the place they belong to and also the craftsmanship involved.",
