@@ -1591,7 +1591,7 @@
             "title": "Dangi Dance",
             "name": "Dangi Dance",
             "desc": "The Dangi of Chamba, Gee dance of Sirmaur, Naati of Kullu, are all a part of their festivities. The vast repertoire of pahari folklore often gets translated into these songs. These ballads dwell on village romances, chivalry and the changing seasons. The songs are",
