           "title": "Temple at Avantipur",
           "name": "Temple at Avantipur",
           "desc": "The famous Avantipur temples are believed to have been built in honour of lord Shiva by Avantivarman who is believed to have founded the city in the ninth century. The temples, although in ruins, are of great archaeological interest. There are two main temples, one larger and marked",
