@@ -1913,7 +1913,7 @@
           "title": "Collections of Pratap Singh Museum",
           "name": "Collections of Pratap Singh Museum",
           "desc": "In Kashmir, Museums at Jammu and Srinagar display valuable collections of miniature paintings, sculptures and terracotta. Shri Pratap Singh Museum, Srinagar has the collections of bronze and stone sculptures of seventh to eleventh centuries of Buddhist as well as Hindu deities in the distinctive style of Kashmir.",
