             "desc": "Madhya Pradesh is well known for papier-mâché items. The main center for papier-mâché is Ujjain but this craft is also popular in Gwalior, Ratlam and Bhopal. Craftsmen from Gwalior and Bhopal make statues of birds, animals and decorative panels. The craftsmen of Ujjain make papier-mâché birds and figures of popular deities. These products",
