@@ -2533,7 +2533,7 @@
           "title": "Madhya Pradesh- Monument- Indore- Rajwada",
           "name": "Madhya Pradesh- Monument- Indore- Rajwada",
           "desc": "The Rajawada with its 7-storeyed gateway is a mixture of French, Mughal and Maratha styles. Its lofty entrance archway above a huge wooden door encrusted with iron studs, leads into a vast courtyard enclosed by galleried rooms. The lower three floors are made of stone and the upper floors are made of wood.",
