             "desc": "Bamboo, is abundantly grown in Churachandpur, Jiribam, Tamenglong and Imphal districts of Manipur. Manipur is the largest producer of bamboo products after Tripura in the entire north-east region. Some of the bamboo products are sofa sets, mats, basketry, tray, chair, table, flower vase, ashtray and other decorative and utility articles.",
