           "name": "Manipur- Fairs and Festivals - Ningol Chakouba",
           "desc": "This is a social festival of the Meiteis (the Vaishnavites) where the women (Ningol) are invited to a feast at their parental house along with their children. It is the festival that binds and revives the family relations between the girls married away and the parents.",
