           "title": "Manipur- Fairs and Festivals  Yaoshang",
           "name": "Manipur- Fairs and Festivals  Yaoshang",
           "desc": "Celebrated for five days starting from the full moon of Phalguna, in the month of March, Yaoshang is a festival like Holi, a riot of colours and water. There is chanting of hymns/slokas by the devotees of Lord Krishna. Another feature of this premiere festival is the Thabal Chongba (Dancing in the Moonlight). The boys from various places come to the site of the festival and dance with the girls by holding on to their hands and moving in circles.",
