             "title": "Cane and Bamboo Craft",
             "name": "Cane and Bamboo Craft",
             "desc": "Cane and bamboo are available in plenty in Meghalaya and used for making houses. Mats of bamboo are made from thin strips which are used for making walls of the houses. Varieties of baskets are made in Meghalaya. The artistic baskets are known as meghum khoks locally. Thugis and other baskets are used for storing day to day items. The Khasi are masters in weaving cane into mats, stools and even umbrellas. The umbrellas are known as Kurup in the local language.",
