@@ -3029,7 +3029,7 @@
           "title": "Mizoram- Fairs and Festivals",
           "name": "Mizoram- Fairs and Festivals",
           "desc": "The festivals of Mizoram are related to the agricultural activities that bring forth the vibrancy and the liveliness of the people of Mizoram. Some of the major festivals in Mizoram which can be mentioned are Chapchar Kut, Mim Kut, Pawl Kut and Thalfavang Kut.",
-          "img": "/state-images/Mizoram/Mizo_ladies31.jpg",
+          "img": "/state-images/Mizoram/Mizo_ladies31.webp",
