@@ -3047,7 +3047,7 @@
           "title": "Mizoram- Fairs and Festivals- Thalfavang Kut",
           "name": "Mizoram- Fairs and Festivals- Thalfavang Kut",
           "desc": "When the farmers complete the process of weeding of the field and prepare for the forthcoming harvest, the Thalfavang Kut festival takes place. This colourful festival gives the community an opportunity to come together, retain the present bonds and renew the old ones.",
-          "img": "/state-images/Mizoram/thalfavang-kut.jpg",
