           "name": "Rajasthan- Fairs and Festival- Urs Ajmer Sharif",
           "desc": "Urs Ajmer Sharif is held according to the lunar calendar in the memory of the revered Sufi saint Khawaja Moinuddin Chisti. It is an occasion for thousands of believers to congregate at the shrine and offer their prayers. All of Ajmer seems to take on",
