         },
@@ -4023,7 +4023,7 @@
           "title": "Nagaur Fair",
           "name": "Nagaur Fair",
           "desc": "The famous Nagaur fair is essentially an animal fair and is held annually between late January and early February. Nagaur becomes active with cattle, horses and camels accompanied by their colorfully turbaned owners. There is earnest bargaining between owners and buyers, and plenty of fun and festivity, games, tug-of-war contests, and camel races.",
