@@ -4034,7 +4034,7 @@
           "title": "Rajasthan- Museum- Shilp Gram",
           "name": "Rajasthan- Museum- Shilp Gram",
           "desc": "Shilp Gram is a Craft village in Udaipur, displaying traditional houses from all over Rajasthan, Gujrat and Maharashtra. Craftsmen can be seen at work, giving live demonstration of making beautiful handicrafts like wooden toys, embroidery, carpets, leather articles and pottery. Rajasthan's vibrant folk music and dance can also be enjoyed here.",
-          "img": "/state-images/Rajasthan/Shilpgram-1.jpg",
