             "desc": "Pietra dura is Agra's fabled inlay work of precious stones like lapiz lazuli and machelite on marble. The mosaics formed by the inlay work range from beautiful floral patterns to free flowing flower and vine themes on table tops, bowls, wall hangings, etc. The best of pietra dura work featuring delicate and intricate mosaics in jewel like colours is made in Agra. Vrindavan is a centre of exquisite alabaster figures, fret work traceries and jaals.",
