@@ -4537,7 +4537,7 @@
             "title": "Uttar Pradesh- Handicrafts- Carpet Weaving",
             "name": "Uttar Pradesh- Handicrafts- Carpet Weaving",
             "desc": "Varanasi and its neighboring areas are well known for carpet making. The Varanasi-Bhadohi-Mirzapur belt in Uttar Pradesh produces maximum number of carpets in the country. They have their own distinct designs such as the Taj Mahal, Kethariwala Jal, Jamabaz, Kandhari, etc. Embossed, sculpted carpets in the Chinese style are also produced in Mirzapur.",
