             "title": "Woodwork",
             "name": "Woodwork",
             "desc": "Saharanpur is well-known for its carved and brass inlay furniture items and other artifacts. Sheesham, sal and dudhi wood are used to make well-finished screens, room dividers and furniture items featuring jaali or lattice work and brass inlay work in floral and geometric patterns. The furniture artifacts are attractive with an increasing amount of contemporary design input.",
