             "name": "Uttarakhand- Handicrafts- Ornaments",
             "desc": "In every part of Garhwal and Kumaon, traditional goldsmiths make traditional ornaments using motifs and patterns which are thousands of years old. The ornaments come in variety of gold, silver, copper and brass.",
