           "desc": "Surrounded by dense forests of fur and pine trees right in the middle of the Almora town are the temples of Nanda Devi and Narsingh. 34 kms from Almora is the ancient Shiva temple complex at Jageshwar. This houses one of the 12 jyotirlingas in the country. This temple",
